# github/gitignore/Go
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories
vendor/

# benchmark
old.txt
new.txt
bench.txt

# profile
*.pprof

# typesafe-sdk-python at the pinned commit: the ci.yaml lint job checks it out
# here for .github/scripts/port-test-matrix.py --upstream upstream.
/upstream/

# Python caches and coverage data from .github/scripts tests
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage

# The spikes live in the private archive. A spike copied back here to
# run again (the archive's README) stays out of every commit.
/_spikes/
